 /**
+ * VitaBrowser patch 252: the frontend's clock -- monotonic microseconds
+ * from an arbitrary start (the Vita's process time; CLOCK_MONOTONIC in the
+ * simulator). Timers, the autotest's settling, the script deadline and
+ * the log stamps all read it. The wall clock steps: WSL moves it ~+1.9 s
+ * every ~32 s (and a Vita's when its time is set), which fired timers
